gme_test.nsf is test.nsf from https://github.com/libgme/game-music-emu tag 0.6.5 (commit 9e23d10f9fd2a6a2f33b10912dd8dc7153258995), 749 bytes, a minimal NES sound test shipped with libgme as its emulator test file. It is distributed inside the libgme repository, whose license is the GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 or later (third_party/gme/LICENSE); the file carries no separate license. Used only as the gme-decode test fixture (row I426).
